### POST /api/ingest/serp — manual tests
### Format: REST Client (VS Code) / Thunder Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### Set these in your client's environment file or replace inline:
@host    = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey  = n8n-secret-key
@projectId = 1


### 1. Valid: 1 minimal SerpAPI item, no AI overview
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "items": [
    {
      "search_metadata": { "created_at": "2026-05-08T10:00:00Z" },
      "search_parameters": {
        "engine": "google",
        "q": "para tunisie",
        "device": "desktop",
        "gl": "tn",
        "hl": "fr"
      },
      "search_information": { "total_results": 1230000 },
      "organic_results": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "title": "Parapharmacie en ligne Tunisie",
          "link": "https://www.paraexpert.tn/",
          "snippet": "Vente de produits de parapharmacie...",
          "sitelinks": { "inline": [{ "title": "Soldes", "link": "https://www.paraexpert.tn/soldes" }] }
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "title": "Parapharmacie tunisienne — autre site",
          "link": "https://example-concurrent.tn/",
          "snippet": "Concurrent direct..."
        }
      ],
      "related_questions": [
        { "question": "Quelle est la meilleure parapharmacie en Tunisie ?", "snippet": "..." }
      ],
      "related_searches": [
        { "query": "parapharmacie tunis" },
        { "query": "para en ligne tunisie" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


### 2. Valid: 1 item WITH AI overview citing our domain
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "items": [
    {
      "search_metadata": { "created_at": "2026-05-08T10:05:00Z" },
      "search_parameters": {
        "engine": "google_ai_overview",
        "q": "creme solaire bebe tunisie",
        "device": "mobile",
        "gl": "tn",
        "hl": "fr"
      },
      "organic_results": [
        {
          "position": 4,
          "title": "Crème solaire bébé — Paraexpert",
          "link": "https://paraexpert.tn/cremes-solaires-bebe",
          "snippet": "Sélection de crèmes solaires pour bébé..."
        }
      ],
      "ai_overview": {
        "text_blocks": [{ "type": "paragraph", "snippet": "Pour les bébés, privilégier..." }],
        "references": [
          { "title": "Paraexpert", "link": "https://paraexpert.tn/cremes-solaires-bebe", "source": "paraexpert.tn" },
          { "title": "Doctissimo", "link": "https://www.doctissimo.fr/article", "source": "doctissimo.fr" }
        ]
      },
      "knowledge_graph": { "title": "Crème solaire", "type": "Skin care product" },
      "inline_videos": [{ "title": "Conseils crème solaire", "link": "https://youtube.com/x" }]
    }
  ]
}


### 3. Project not found (404)
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "projectId": 99999,
  "items": [
    {
      "search_parameters": { "q": "test", "engine": "google" }
    }
  ]
}


### 4. Invalid body (400) — missing search_parameters
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "items": [
    { "organic_results": [] }
  ]
}


### 5. Invalid body (400) — missing items
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "projectId": {{projectId}} }


### 6. Item containing SerpAPI error — should NOT crash, should appear in errors[]
###    (this still requires search_parameters to pass Zod, but the engine returned an error string)
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "items": [
    {
      "search_parameters": { "q": "broken keyword", "engine": "google", "device": "desktop" },
      "error": "SerpAPI rate limit reached"
    },
    {
      "search_metadata": { "created_at": "2026-05-08T11:00:00Z" },
      "search_parameters": { "q": "working keyword", "engine": "google", "device": "desktop", "gl": "tn", "hl": "fr" },
      "organic_results": [
        { "position": 1, "title": "x", "link": "https://paraexpert.tn/x" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


### 7. Wrong API key (401)
POST {{host}}/api/ingest/serp
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: wrong-key

{ "projectId": {{projectId}}, "items": [] }
